{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"yululu-p-8370ff12c10154","name":"门吏（麋芳营门）","evidence":["yululu-q-50aa49fd4b2a99252058"],"facts":[],"mentions":[{"id":"yululu-m-3d712db4366901723ccb","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及门吏，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["yululu-q-50aa49fd4b2a99252058"]}],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yululu-q-50aa49fd4b2a99252058","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-38a0ecfd22d008f57d4d","layer":"original","quote":"翻尝乘船行，与麋芳相逢。芳船上人多欲令翻自避，先驱曰：“避将军船！”翻厉声曰：“失忠与信，何以事君？倾人二城〖7〗，而称将军，可乎！”芳阖户不应而遽避之〖8〗。后翻乘车行，又经芳营〔中〕；门吏闭门，车不得过。翻复怒曰：“（当闭反开，当开反闭）〔当开反闭，当闭反开〕〖9〗，岂得事宜邪！”芳闻之，有惭色。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
